## Project Structure

```
├── start.py                    # Interactive CLI entry point
├── Dockerfile                  # Container image definition
├── docker-compose.yml          # Multi-service orchestration (API + Open WebUI)
├── pyproject.toml              # Project config & dependencies (uv)
├── .env.example                # Template for API keys
├── .env                        # API keys (gitignored)
├── data/
│   ├── raw/                    # Source PDFs (DRR, DRG, EPSF)
│   ├── processed/
│   │   ├── text/               # Docling markdown output
│   │   └── chunks/             # JSONL chunks (≤512 tokens)
│   ├── eval/                   # 187 gold Q&A benchmark
│   ├── Eval RAG metrics/       # Retrieval ablation results
│   ├── ragas/                  # RAGAS evaluation artifacts
│   └── vector_db/qdrant/       # Qdrant embedded storage
├── src/rag_sn_in/
│   ├── config.py               # Shared model/path constants
│   ├── api/main.py             # OpenAI-compatible FastAPI server
│   ├── database/               # Qdrant client & collection setup
│   ├── ingestion/              # Docling PDF → markdown pipeline
│   ├── processing/             # Structure-aware chunking
│   ├── llm/                    # Embedding, reranker, retrieval, generation
│   ├── eval/                   # Retrieval evaluation (Hit@K, MRR, Recall)
│   ├── observability/          # Langfuse client
│   └── cleanse/                # DB cleanup utilities
├── RAG_FINAL_VERDICT.md        # Full evaluation report
└── IDEAs.tex                   # Project design document
```

